    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59425" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούκινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of
